abstract: >-
  Result-reproduction software for provenance-grounded selective assurance in
  borehole database ingestion. The published Zenodo software archive at
  10.5281/zenodo.22043933 contains version paper4-cageo-v1.0.9 and is aligned
  with the v1.0.9 GitHub release without changing frozen scientific results.
  MIT applies to source code only. The manuscript,
  author-created artwork, and third-party or source-derived materials remain
  subject to their applicable terms. The separately published data-v002
  companion is 10.5281/zenodo.22031703 and remains subject to source-specific
  terms.
